### Test a valid spin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/spin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bet": 10
}

### Test an invalid (too low) bet
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/spin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bet": -1
}

### Get Initial Game State (Balance and Last Spin)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/init
Accept: application/json